<title>USA: American Resources acquires acerage stake.</title>
<headline>American Resources acquires acerage stake.</headline>
<dateline>VERSAILLES, Ky. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Resources of Delaware Inc said Tuesday it has acquired a 25 percent working interest in certain onshore Gulf Coast undeveloped properties located in Greene and Wayne Counties, Mississippi.</p>
<p>The largest working interest owner and operator is Aviara Energy Corp located in Houston, Texas.</p>
<p>It is anticipated that the first well on these properties will be drilled during 1997. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
